{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Play the free demo</strong> \u2014 a short and funny phone-sim adventure in 9 languages!<br>Make calls, chat with friends, and order food through the cracks of a broken screen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh no! Dropped your phone again?</strong> \ud83d\udca5  <br>Nice job. \ud83d\udc4d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how far can you go?  <br>Before you finally give up using it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf1 Smashing My Phone\u2122</strong> isn't just a game.  <br>It\u2019s <i>the ultimate test of your broken phone survival skills.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap. Swipe. Suffer. Repeat.</strong> \ud83d\udd01  <br>Until you become a true <i>Modern Survivalist.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This isn\u2019t just a game.</i><br><strong>This is our life.</strong> \u2601\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/a2bf1b384bf9f1c53e0bd65cc55241c4.webp?t=1761745239\" width=1560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smashing My Phone\u2122</strong> is a <strong>phone-sim puzzle adventure</strong> about <strong>surviving another day with a shattered screen.</strong><br>Use a smartphone filled with everyday apps and find clever ways to complete your daily tasks <strong>despite the cracks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Phone-sim puzzles:</strong> Operate familiar apps like <strong>calls, chats, food delivery, and banking</strong> to handle the small yet chaotic routines of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Cracked-screen challenges:</strong> Some parts of the screen <strong>don\u2019t respond\u2014find your own ways to work around the damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude05 <strong>Light humor:</strong> Enjoy <strong>small jokes and relatable moments</strong> across messages, notifications, and daily apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story bits:</strong> Follow a <strong>college freshman</strong> clinging to his cracked phone, surviving modern life <strong>one swipe at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.poster.avif?t=1761745239\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.webm?t=1761745239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.mp4?t=1761745239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080590?t=1761745239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080590?t=1761745239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/185f314ab7ec9bb52e647665db42911e0f448b8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761745239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/185f314ab7ec9bb52e647665db42911e0f448b8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761745239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4118940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Play the free demo</strong> \u2014 a short and funny phone-sim adventure 